    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Lesly,\n\nMy earlier note asked about designing client communication as you build Benavides Law. This article looks at a related choice: adding AI to existing routines or designing the routines around it.\n\nThe main point is that clear responsibilities and shared information matter as much as the technology. That's shaping our work with PI firms at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/KYFvl-g00Q\n\nAs founder, would you find it harder to choose the AI or decide how the team should work with it? I'd appreciate a quick take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: A client-trust question",
